Subject: [PATCH] certificates: stage and validate complete authority replacements

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD certificate preservation]

Retain the old CA objects and storage through snapshotting, parsing, X509
verification, and hash-link creation. Commit a complete directory, using
rename exchange where supported and a recoverable directory rename on
JFFS2. Roll back on reload submission failure. Reject bundles without CAs.

